WEBVTT

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:12.150
Huh. It's grown in already.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:15.190
I'm growing up at a steady pace.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.810
Good.

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:20.440
I didn't like studying English in my old life,

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.770
but new languages are surprisingly fun.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:34.440
Good, but you need to
work on closing distance!

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:34.440
It's been two years since she turned ten.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:36.600
Eris reached Advanced rank
in Sword God Style in no time.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:35.180
Right!

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.400
I can feel our gap in talent.

00:00:42.940 --> 00:00:46.020
I think it's bigger than before.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:50.690
Really, what is that thing? It's a mystery.

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:20.990
Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:27.020
Hurry up! Rudeus will spot us!

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:31.900
I can't wait to see his reaction!
He might cry for joy!

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:35.690
This is Master Rudeus we're
talking about. He might not show it.

00:02:35.690 --> 00:02:37.650
But he'll like it, won't he?!

00:02:37.650 --> 00:02:39.730
Of course he will.

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:44.350
I'm sure he suffers for
being from a branch house.

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:42.270
What is it?

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:44.350
Talking behind my back?

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:45.980
In that case, I'm confident.

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:50.350
Confident the maids will have more work
once I'm done sobbing into my pillow.

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:54.350
We have to get it ready
for Rudeus's tenth birthday!

00:02:55.770 --> 00:03:00.060
If only he'd been born into a different family.

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:06.400
Apparently, the Boreas family
can't be too public about me.

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:08.770
How do you do, Master Rudeus?

00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:10.560
Hello.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:16.600
I only learned this recently,
but Paul's full name is Paul <i>Notos</i> Greyrat.

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:19.730
The Notos are one of the
four main Greyrat families.

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:21.940
Their head is Paul's brother.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:25.020
But apparently, he's even scummier than Paul,

00:03:25.020 --> 00:03:28.900
so there's a covert movement to replace him.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:30.480
Even if I don't want to,

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:34.190
a member of the Notos bloodline
being under Boreas protection

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:37.100
could invite unwelcome misunderstandings.

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:40.690
So, I can't have a big party like Eris did.

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:42.940
They must feel bad about that.

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:47.350
It looks like they're planning a
private tenth birthday party for me.

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:49.650
It's not really a tear-jerker.

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:53.230
I'd better practice my crying.

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:58.230
Still,

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:02.020
I've been in this world
for almost ten years now.

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.900
Everyone seems busy.

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:13.940
I-I guess so.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:17.850
Still, you learned three languages in two years?

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:20.230
You never cease to surprise me.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:23.730
I figured out Beast-God
thanks to you, Ghislaine.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:26.190
Studying is hungry work, huh?

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:28.690
Let's go grab a snack.

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:32.770
W-Wait a minute, Rudeus.

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:36.270
C-Could we talk a little more?

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:37.900
Ah-ha.

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:41.690
Today's the day, isn't it?

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:43.400
All right.

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.480
This is a perfect opportunity.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:48.190
I have something to show you.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:53.850
Is this me?

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:55.730
It's pretty well made.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:58.150
Hmm? It's missing my tail.

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:00.270
I don't quite know how it works.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.730
I see.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:06.480
It looks like she'll do everything
she can to keep me here.

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:09.600
Would you mind showing me the base of your tail?

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:12.230
Now, how will you get out of this, Ghislaine?

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:13.900
What, that's all?

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:15.440
That's easy.

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:16.770
Zero hesitation!

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:19.060
Wow! That's our Ghislaine!

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:20.940
I-I'm no match for her!

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:23.020
M-May I touch it?

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:25.230
Yes, of course.

00:05:27.060 --> 00:05:28.520
Huh? It's hard!

00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:32.440
Hang on. Is this really a butt?

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:36.770
W-Whoa! I always wanted muscle like this.

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.940
Excuse me, Master Rudeus.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:41.100
Dinner is re--

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:47.480
Rudeus!

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:50.940
Happy tenth birthday!

00:05:56.690 --> 00:05:58.560
Wh-What?

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:00.900
Rudeus,

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:02.730
happy birthday!

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:06.900
Oh, yeah. I'm ten years old today.

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:13.020
S-Sorry.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:15.440
I-It's just that

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.350
this is new to me.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:18.810
Since I got here,

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:21.310
I worried I might not be welcome.

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:25.940
I-I never thought... you'd throw a party for me.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.520
T-To arms!

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:29.770
It's war with the Notos!

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:32.810
I'll murder Pilemon and put Rudeus in charge!

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:34.150
F-Father! Restrain yourself!

00:06:34.150 --> 00:06:36.940
Philip! Don't you dare stop me!

00:06:36.940 --> 00:06:38.850
You fool!

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:41.690
Let go of me! Let go!

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:44.810
W-Was my acting too good?

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:47.730
F-Forget about Grandfather.

00:06:47.730 --> 00:06:50.850
I've got a surprise for you today, Rudeus!

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:52.810
What is it?

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:54.900
Take a guess!

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:58.350
Are Father and the others coming?

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:01.190
Huh? Uh, well...

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.940
We did invite your family,

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:07.850
but monsters have been acting up,
and they couldn't make it.

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:10.770
I see. That's a shame.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:12.730
Uh, umm...

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:14.650
Listen, Rudeus...

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:16.810
You see...

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:18.900
Huh? Oh no.

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:20.980
This isn't the mood I wanted. Whoa!

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:24.310
Rudeus! You're one of our children now!

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:28.060
Huh? I thought she hated me.

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:29.560
I'll adopt you.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:31.980
No! Marry Eris!

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:33.600
M-Mother?!

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:36.600
Is my Rudeus not good enough for you, Eris?!

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:38.480
Rudeus is only ten!

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:40.350
Age has nothing to do with it!

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:43.270
You need to be more feminine and--

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.400
What are you doing?!

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:48.400
Unhand me! I must save that child!

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:50.730
So, what is it?

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:52.900
The surprise, I mean.

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:54.770
R-Right.

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:59.150
Alphonse! Give it to him!

00:07:59.150 --> 00:08:00.600
At once.

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:03.150
For you, sir.

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:04.980
A staff?

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:07.270
For your sake, Master Rudeus,

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:11.310
we gathered the finest
materials from around the world

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:16.440
and had this fashioned by the
Asura Kingdom's foremost staff-maker.

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:18.020
Its name is

00:08:18.020 --> 00:08:20.730
Aqua Heartia.

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:26.520
I can tell at a glance:
This staff cost a fortune.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:28.520
Even if its name is kind of lame.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:29.600
Take it!

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:34.310
You're a great mage, so it's weird
that you don't have a staff!

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:35.900
Thank you very much.

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:37.730
It's such a valuable gift.

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:39.730
The price doesn't matter!

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:43.020
Now, let the party begin!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.600
Rudeus...

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:08.270
Happy birthday...

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:14.940
Eris had two brothers,
one older and one younger.

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:21.060
My brother in the capital
took them right after birth.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:22.690
He <i>took</i> them?

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:25.940
I lost a succession dispute.

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:30.440
All men of Boreas blood are raised
in the head of the family's household.

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:34.100
That's our tradition.

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:37.100
But Hilda refused to accept that.

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:42.770
That's only natural.
Her own children were taken from her.

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:45.230
She hated you.

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:47.310
Her own sons can't be here,

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:52.060
so why is someone else's walking
around like he owns the place?

00:09:58.940 --> 00:10:01.900
Don't think badly of her.

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:04.980
I don't intend to.

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:07.980
Well?

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:13.440
Would you really marry Eris
and take over the Boreas family?

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:16.520
What do you expect from a ten-year-old?

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:20.520
All you need to do is sit still.
I'll handle the coup.

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:26.310
If you want, I'll leave Eris in your
bed with her hands tied tonight.

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:32.350
Take over the Boreas family? Wait, hang on.

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:36.520
This is no joke. I want no
part of power struggles.

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:40.650
Let's leave it as idle chitchat over wine.

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:43.310
Is that so? What a shame.

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:45.770
Well then, I should get to bed.

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:47.270
Yes. Goodnight.

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:49.270
Goodnight.

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:00.690
Goodnight, Master Rudeus.

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:03.400
Goodnight.

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:09.440
If I took Philip's deal, I could have
made my own harem of personal maids.

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:12.650
Ah! What a wasted opportunity!

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:16.900
W-W-Welcome home.

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:18.810
I'm home.

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:26.480
What's wrong? I thought you went to bed.

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:30.770
I-I thought you'd get lonely,
so I'll sleep here tonight!

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:33.400
Did Philip put her up to this?

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:37.480
Still, now I look at her, she's quite...

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.350
Rudeus.

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:59.230
My <i>first</i> first time could be a
haughty, <i>tsundere</i> loli's first time.

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:01.980
S-Stop.

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:03.350
N-No, I can't!

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:04.600
I can't touch her!

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:07.350
This is just what Philip wants.

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:13.310
I-I'm feeling lonely today, so I might
try something dirty, you know?

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:18.400
F-Fine. A-As long as it's just a little!

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:20.100
Huh?

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:26.560
It's what Philip wants? Who cares?

00:12:26.560 --> 00:12:28.690
Nothing ventured, nothing gained.

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:32.150
I should be happy to accept a little risk.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.060
You're trembling.

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:37.350
Y-You're imagining it!

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:39.770
Her hair is silky smooth.

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:42.940
Eris trains day in and day out.

00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:46.270
Her hair is normally messier.

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:48.150
You're cute, Eris.

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:50.400
Where did that come from?!

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:56.060
I'll touch you.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:10.060
Is she actually okay with this?

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:11.230
She is, right?

00:13:11.230 --> 00:13:13.480
I can do it? I'm good to go?

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.350
O-Okay!

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:16.980
Here goes!

00:13:22.350 --> 00:13:23.230
N--

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:24.770
No!

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:30.400
I said, "just a little"!

00:13:30.400 --> 00:13:31.810
That's...!

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:34.730
Rudeus, you idiot!

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:46.150
What was I thinking?

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:48.520
I completely forgot myself.

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:53.310
Did I think I knew how love interests
feel after playing all those dating sims?

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:56.020
This is why virgin guys suck.

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:01.350
Maybe Eris has been so enthusiastic lately

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:06.940
because she was worried I might
end up lonely on my birthday.

00:14:10.480 --> 00:14:12.730
I'll apologize.

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:16.900
I-I'm sorry!

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:20.480
This is a special day, so I'll make
an exception and forgive you!

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:22.520
Sh-She forgave me.

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:25.770
But it's still too soon
for th-that sort of thing.

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:26.650
Five years!

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:30.190
In another five years, you'll be a proper adult!

00:14:30.190 --> 00:14:32.520
And then...

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:34.730
Until then, control yourself!

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:37.310
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:40.020
W-Well then, I'm going to bed now!

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:43.600
Bye, Rudeus. Goodnight!

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:46.650
See you tomorrow!

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:54.060
Thank God!

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:56.100
Thank God it's my birthday.

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:58.100
Thank God it's a special day.

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.600
Thank God I didn't do anything worse.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:02.230
And...

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:03.900
Yes!

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:06.810
It's settled! Eris promised!

00:15:06.810 --> 00:15:10.020
Okay. No more indulgences until then.

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:11.650
Five years. I'll be 15.

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:13.650
It's a long time, but I can wait.

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:14.980
I can do it!

00:15:14.980 --> 00:15:18.690
I'll become so tough no sexy event can faze me!

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:19.690
Hmm?

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:21.440
Wait, five years?

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:26.940
S-Sylphie!

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:33.850
Damn it. What's going on?

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:36.190
Where are they coming from?

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:40.230
It looks like monsters
aren't just acting up here.

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:43.850
Similar incidents are being
reported all over Fittoa.

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:48.150
I wanted to go to my son's tenth birthday party.

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:51.810
I hope Rudeus is doing all right.

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:54.560
Hello.

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:56.770
Oh, hello, Sylphie.

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:59.730
Come on, Norn. Say hello.

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:02.270
Hello, Norn.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:08.190
Aisha, make sure you wipe the corners, too.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.690
I will!

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:11.400
Hello, Lilia.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:12.650
Hello.

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:14.980
Please deliver this.

00:16:14.980 --> 00:16:17.940
What a lovely pendant.

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:21.400
I made it based on one my dad treasures.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:25.480
I'll take charge of it and
make sure it reaches him.

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:29.400
Have you decided what you
want to do for Rudy, Lilia?

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:33.810
Yes. I'm going to send him this.

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.100
What is it?

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:38.600
Something that Master Rudeus treasured dearly.

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:39.440
Really?

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:40.520
Big sis!

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:42.150
Aisha!

00:16:42.150 --> 00:16:43.440
Yay!

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:46.150
You clean every day. That's great.

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:50.150
I'm so glad Sylphie cheered up.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:53.980
The way she acted out after Master
Rudeus left for Roa was incredible.

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:58.520
I can't believe some of
the things Rudy taught her.

00:16:58.520 --> 00:17:02.190
But I hear she stopped
being bullied as a result,

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:03.480
so I'm glad he did.

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:04.480
With her hair,

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:09.730
she only needs a red gem on her
forehead to look just like a Superd.

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:11.980
What's a Superd?

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:16.400
The Superd are the scariest
demons in the whole world.

00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:18.310
If you meet one,

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:21.150
they'll eat you up!

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:25.310
Oh!

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:27.560
I'm sorry. Don't cry.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:28.980
I'm home.

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.600
Welcome home, dear.

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:31.850
Welcome home.

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:33.520
What's the matter?

00:17:33.520 --> 00:17:35.230
There, there.

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:36.520
Monsters again?

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:39.600
Yeah. I don't know what's gotten into them.

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:42.020
It's unprecedented.

00:17:45.650 --> 00:17:48.440
What's that cloud?

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:56.650
Roxy, I don't care about studying.

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:59.520
Just take your clothes off.

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:08.150
What is that?

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:12.440
Isn't the Asura Kingdom in that direction?

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:16.600
Could it be... Rudeus?

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:19.810
Mana is gathering?

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:22.850
What's gone wrong, and where?

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:28.940
Oh, well. I'll find out when I get there.

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:34.480
Oh, that's an absurd amount of mana.

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:37.690
Whose spell is this?

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:40.020
What? We can't see them.

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:44.480
They must be shy. What a nuisance.

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:47.520
In that case, We'll go meet them face to face!

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:50.560
We are the Great Emperor of the Demon World,

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:53.400
Kishirika Kishirisu!

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:56.810
Follow Us, Our people!

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:12.020
This mana resembles the light of summoning.

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:17.150
Could someone be seeking to undo
the seal on the Demon-God Laplace?

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:21.100
Almanfi!

00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:22.270
Here.

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:24.940
Investigate the source of that mana.

00:20:24.940 --> 00:20:28.520
Slay any suspicious persons on sight.

00:20:28.520 --> 00:20:30.190
As you wish.

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.770
We've come a long way.

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:39.350
We can see your strongest
spell out here, right, Rudeus?!

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:41.310
Ta-dah!

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:49.520
Wow. I can do all that with so little mana?

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:50.770
H-How is it?

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:55.060
It will be hard to fine-tune,
but it's incredible.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:58.060
Really?! Good!

00:20:58.060 --> 00:20:59.100
Now,

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:03.690
the moment you've been waiting for:
Rudeus Greyrat's mightiest spell.

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:07.100
Behold: Cumulonimbus!

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:10.190
Gather, mana!

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:14.600
Grand spirit of water and
imperial prince of lightning who...

00:21:14.600 --> 00:21:16.100
Huh?

00:21:22.600 --> 00:21:25.650
What's that? Is it Rudeus's spell?

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:28.060
No. That's not me.

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:31.810
What incredible mana.

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:33.230
You can tell?

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:34.980
Should we return to Roa?

00:21:34.980 --> 00:21:37.650
Yes. We should get away from...

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:39.770
Get down!

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:40.600
Huh?

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:42.190
What?!

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:04.190
Who...?

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:06.150
Who are you?!

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:08.400
I am Almanfi the Radiant.

00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:13.230
By order of Lord Perugius, I have come
to slay the source of this disturbance.

00:22:13.230 --> 00:22:14.480
Perugius?

00:22:14.480 --> 00:22:17.020
Rudeus! Take Lady Eris and fall back!

00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:18.650
Step aside, woman.

00:22:18.650 --> 00:22:21.560
If I slay that boy, the disturbance may cease.

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:24.400
I'm the Sword King Ghislaine Dedoldia.

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:27.190
We have nothing to do with that. Leave!

00:22:27.190 --> 00:22:30.190
You are a Sword King?

00:22:30.190 --> 00:22:33.440
I swear it by my teacher,
the Sword God Gal Farion,

00:22:33.440 --> 00:22:36.060
and the honor of Doldia!

00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:39.850
Very well.

00:22:39.850 --> 00:22:44.480
If what you say is false,
Lord Perugius will judge you later.

00:22:44.480 --> 00:22:47.020
No apology for attacking us without warning?!

00:22:47.020 --> 00:22:50.480
It's your fault for arousing
suspicion in such a place.

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:53.440
What the hell is going on? I don't understand.

00:22:53.440 --> 00:22:55.190
Calm down.

00:22:55.190 --> 00:22:59.400
First, the sky changed,
then a man suddenly appeared.

00:22:59.400 --> 00:23:02.900
He says he works for a legendary
hero who's in history books.

00:23:02.900 --> 00:23:06.810
A celebrity like that appeared
out of nowhere and attacked me.

00:23:06.020 --> 00:23:08.730
Hey, what's going on?!

00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:09.900
It seems like he thinks I did this to the sky.

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:11.810
I didn't, but...

00:23:16.270 --> 00:23:18.600
P-Please, wait! Tell us what--

00:23:18.600 --> 00:23:19.900
Huh?

00:23:29.810 --> 00:23:31.810
Lady Eris! Rudeus!

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:33.190
Eris!

00:23:34.650 --> 00:23:36.020
Eris!

00:23:38.980 --> 00:23:41.980
Episode 8

00:23:38.980 --> 00:23:41.980
Turning Point 1

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:46.980
Next time

00:23:42.730 --> 00:23:46.980
A Chance Encounter
